# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts
#
# In the predecessor repository every application compiled the whole kernel
# into its own private build/ directory, leaving 18,223 .o and 10,519 .d files
# across 233 build/ and 173 output/ directories. The unified CMake build keeps
# objects out of the source tree, but these rules stay as a backstop.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# build*/ , not build/ + build-*/ : a directory named build15 or
# buildgcc14 slipped through the narrower pair and got committed once.
build*/
cmake-build*/
output/
target/

*.o
*.obj
*.d
*.a
*.elf
*.hex
*.bin
*.lst
*.map
*.su

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hardware run / flash artifacts (hw.sh, OpenOCD, J-Link)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.hw-run*
.hw-jlink-run*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# QEMU fixtures
#
# Disk images generated for the SD-backed rpi tests; regenerated on demand.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/disk*.img

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored
#
# *.html  -- the vendored kernel ships doxygen templates as .html
#            (doxygen/header.html, doxygen/orig/{header,footer}.html).
#            They are upstream source, not generated output. A blanket
#            *.html rule silently drops them when the kernel is copied in.
# *.pdf   -- docs/ carries rendered PDFs alongside their .md sources.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~
